    /// |  |  |  |
    /// | --- | --- | --- |
    /// | 4 x 2 |  | 4 x 7 |
    /// |  | 2 x 3 |  |
    /// |  | 3 x 3 | 3 x 7 |
    /// | 4 x 2 |  |  |
    /// |  | 5 x 3 | 5 x 7 |
    ///
